@prefix dfcm: <https://ggen.io/dfcm/explore#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

dfcm:Candidate a dfcm:Class .
dfcm:Retained a dfcm:Standing .
dfcm:Rejected a dfcm:Standing .
dfcm:ConstructOnly a dfcm:AuthorityBoundary .
dfcm:ExplorationRun a dfcm:Run ; dfcm:authority dfcm:ConstructOnly ; dfcm:minNewCommits "25"^^xsd:integer .
